:: Event_Unlock_Spell
    <<if lastVisited("Event_Unlock_Spell") < 2>>
        <div class="achievebg">
            <h1 class='achieve text-center'>Huge Advancement!</h1>
        </div>
        <<speech plr>>I think I just learned my first spell!!!<</speech>>
        <<speech plr>>It came from the tome <i>$eventVar.spell.book</i> and has taught me the <i>$eventVar.spell.name</i> spell!<</speech>>\

        <<elseif hasVisited("Event_Unlock_Spell")>>
            <<speech plr>>I learned the <i>$eventVar.spell.name</i> spell from the tome, <i>$eventVar.spell.book</i>!<</speech>>\
    <</if>>\

    <<button [[Continue | previous()]]>>
    <</button>>